欲自賢於萬代，其若宗廟何！」高祖感其言，乃一進粥。轉授宮輿曹少卿，加給事中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p001:m0000","assertion_id":"a-ws058-chun-chun-brother-bo","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B758&oldid=2087998","scope":"僅明父或相鄰兄弟來源作可撤回同父組裝；不補同母、絕對排行，不另造source father。"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001","quote":"楊播，字延慶，自云恒農華陰人也。高祖結，仕慕容氏，卒於中山相。曾祖珍，太祖時歸國，卒於上谷太守。祖真，河內、清河二郡太守。父懿，延興末為廣平太守，有稱績。高祖南巡，吏人頌之，加寧遠將軍，賜帛三百匹。徵為選部給事中，有公平之譽。除安南將軍、洛州刺史，未之任而卒。贈以本官，加弘農公，諡曰簡。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001:m0062","assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-001","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B758&oldid=2087998","scope":"僅明父或相鄰兄弟來源作可撤回同父組裝；不補同母、絕對排行，不另造source father。"}],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-001","sibling_person_ids":["fum_370_iq6_AAAC","fum_370_iq6_AAAB","fum_370_iq6_AAAA"],"sibling_assertion_ids":["a-ws058-chun-shun-brother-ying","a-ws058-chun-ying-brother-chun","a-ws058-chun-chun-brother-bo"]},"assembly_id":"family-hongnong-yang-jie-close","root_person_id":"fum_370_iq6","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false},{"person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAE","representative_source_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAE","source_person_ids":["fum_370_iq6_AAAE"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAA","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_sibling","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"具名兄弟與鏈末明父來源支持編輯同父接合；非逐人原文明父，不補母或絕對排行。","references":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p004","quote":"延昌末，起為右將軍、華州刺史，與兄播前後皆牧本州，當世榮之。先是，受調絹匹，度尺特長，在事因緣，共相進退，百姓苦之。津乃令依公尺度其輸物，尤好者賜以杯酒而出；所輸少劣，亦為受之，但無酒，以示其耻。於是人競相勸，官調更勝舊日。還除北中郎將，帶河內太守。太后疑津貳己，不欲使其處河山之要，轉平北將軍、肆州刺史，仍轉并州刺史，將軍如故。徵拜右衞將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p004:m0058","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p004:m0017","assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-jin-brother-bo","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B758&oldid=2087998","scope":"僅明父或具名兄弟鏈作可撤回父系組裝；不補同母、絕對排行，不生成source father。"},{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001","quote":"楊播，字延慶，自云恒農華陰人也。高祖結，仕慕容氏，卒於中山相。曾祖珍，太祖時歸國，卒於上谷太守。祖真，河內、清河二郡太守。父懿，延興末為廣平太守，有稱績。高祖南巡，吏人頌之，加寧遠將軍，賜帛三百匹。徵為選部給事中，有公平之譽。除安南將軍、洛州刺史，未之任而卒。贈以本官，加弘農公，諡曰簡。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p001:m0062","assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-001","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%AD%8F%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B758&oldid=2087998","scope":"僅明父或具名兄弟鏈作可撤回父系組裝；不補同母、絕對排行，不生成source father。"}],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-001","sibling_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAA","sibling_assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-jin-brother-bo"},"assembly_id":"family-hongnong-yang-jie-close","root_person_id":"fum_370_iq6","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false},{"person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAF","representative_source_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAF","source_person_ids":["fum_370_iq6_AAAF"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAA","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_sibling_chain","status":"contextual_provisional","human_review